# EXPERIMENTAL SITL-ONLY override for rigid-body PA-MPPI.
# Load AFTER config/mppi_velocity.parm using a second --add-param-file.
# Bit 3 makes SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET.thrust a normalized collective thrust value.
# Without this override ArduCopter interprets the field as climb rate.
GUID_OPTIONS 8
# Calibrated from existing SITL logs (learned values about 0.36--0.386).
MOT_THST_HOVER 0.38
MOT_HOVER_LEARN 0
